WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.567 --> 00:00:04.167
-We don't always have time
to cover all of the recent news.

00:00:04.167 --> 00:00:06.968
So here with a recap is one
of our writers, Amber Ruffin,

00:00:06.968 --> 00:00:09.434
in a segment called
"Amber Says What."

00:00:09.434 --> 00:00:12.100
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:15.167
-You guys,
things have been crazy!

00:00:15.167 --> 00:00:18.434
Okay, first of all,
WNBA star Brittney Griner

00:00:18.434 --> 00:00:20.367
was released from prison
in Russia.

00:00:20.367 --> 00:00:21.868
And I was like, "What?!"

00:00:21.868 --> 00:00:24.901
Then Republican idiots
Marjorie Taylor Greene

00:00:24.901 --> 00:00:28.334
and Lauren Boebert had beef,
and I was like, "What?"

00:00:28.334 --> 00:00:30.968
Then everybody was talking
about nepo babies,

00:00:30.968 --> 00:00:33.234
and I was like,
"What...is that?"

00:00:33.234 --> 00:00:36.334
So the way it works is,
if a famous person has a child

00:00:36.334 --> 00:00:39.334
and that child grows up to be
famous, they're a nepo baby.

00:00:39.334 --> 00:00:40.400
Like Seth.

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:42.200
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:44.534
-I'm not a nepo baby.

00:00:44.534 --> 00:00:47.067
-Yes, you are.
Lorne Michaels is your dad.

00:00:47.067 --> 00:00:48.167
[ Laughter ]

00:00:48.167 --> 00:00:49.868
-No, he's not.

00:00:49.868 --> 00:00:52.534
-Then why do you need
his approval so bad?

00:00:52.534 --> 00:00:54.667
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:56.033 --> 00:00:59.767
-Maybe he -- Maybe he is my dad.

00:00:59.767 --> 00:01:02.834
-So it turns out that,
like, every famous person

00:01:02.834 --> 00:01:04.767
is related
to another famous person.

00:01:04.767 --> 00:01:06.300
And I was like, "What?!"

00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:08.434
And people were mad about it,
but I wasn't,

00:01:08.434 --> 00:01:10.234
because I'm a nepo baby, too.

00:01:10.234 --> 00:01:14.567
My moms are Sheryl Lee Ralph
and Janelle Monáe.

00:01:14.567 --> 00:01:16.234
That's not true.
I'm lying.

00:01:16.234 --> 00:01:18.901
Just like my no-good dad,
New Edition.

00:01:18.901 --> 00:01:20.400
Okay, so for a while there,

00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:22.701
everybody was doing
that Lensa AI thing,

00:01:22.701 --> 00:01:25.267
where you upload a bunch
of photos of yourself

00:01:25.267 --> 00:01:28.434
and it spits out a bunch of
beautiful illustrations of you.

00:01:28.434 --> 00:01:31.234
And I saw those transformations
and I was like, "What?!

00:01:31.234 --> 00:01:32.567
I'm gonna do it!"

00:01:32.567 --> 00:01:35.267
But then people were like,
"Do not use this software.

00:01:35.267 --> 00:01:37.234
It owns the pictures
you upload to it."

00:01:37.234 --> 00:01:39.534
And I was like,
"Pictures like this?"

00:01:39.534 --> 00:01:41.267
And they were like, "Yes.
It's dangerous.

00:01:41.267 --> 00:01:43.467
Don't do that."
And I was like, "Don't do this?"

00:01:43.467 --> 00:01:45.868
And they were like, "Yes!"
And I was like, "This?"

00:01:45.934 --> 00:01:47.934
And they were like, "Yes!"
And I was like, "This?"

00:01:47.934 --> 00:01:50.767
And they were like, "Yes!"
And I was like, "Too late!"

00:01:50.767 --> 00:01:53.501
So then I heard something crazy.

00:01:53.501 --> 00:01:58.334
I heard that in 2023, Bill Cosby
is reportedly going on tour.

00:01:58.334 --> 00:02:01.300
And I was like, "What?!"

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:03.267
What kind of tour?

00:02:03.267 --> 00:02:04.968
An apology tour?

00:02:04.968 --> 00:02:08.133
Why would you pay money
to see Bill Cosby?

00:02:08.133 --> 00:02:09.801
So you can keep an eye on him?

00:02:09.801 --> 00:02:12.868
Makes you feel better knowing
where he's at at all times?

00:02:12.868 --> 00:02:15.667
How are you going to sit
in the audience, like this?

00:02:15.667 --> 00:02:18.701
[ Laughter ]

00:02:18.701 --> 00:02:20.901
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:24.767 --> 00:02:26.000
Big "no, thank you."

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:28.567
So then something
very normal happened.

00:02:28.567 --> 00:02:31.601
A politician got caught in
a lie, and I was like, "What?"

00:02:31.601 --> 00:02:33.033
But then I found out it was

00:02:33.033 --> 00:02:35.133
Republican representative
George Santos,

00:02:35.133 --> 00:02:37.801
and I was like,
"What...did he say?"

00:02:37.801 --> 00:02:39.834
So the answer is everything!

00:02:39.834 --> 00:02:43.234
Alright, he said he was Jewish,
but then when pressed about it,

00:02:43.234 --> 00:02:46.300
he said, "I'm not Jewish,
I'm Jew-ish."

00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:50.934
And I was like, "Are you
stealing my boss's jokes?"

00:02:50.934 --> 00:02:52.667
-People were going up to
my mother-in-law and saying,

00:02:52.667 --> 00:02:53.734
"Is Seth Jewish?"

00:02:53.734 --> 00:02:55.767
And she was saying,
"He's Jew-ish."

00:02:55.767 --> 00:02:58.100
[ Laughter ]

00:02:58.100 --> 00:02:59.200
-Thievery!

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:01.968
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:01.968 --> 00:03:05.667
But the lies didn't stop there.

00:03:05.667 --> 00:03:07.200
He lied about so many things

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:09.167
that we've got to
do one of these!

00:03:09.167 --> 00:03:10.801
Look at all these lies!

00:03:10.801 --> 00:03:18.133
♪♪

00:03:18.133 --> 00:03:25.467
♪♪

00:03:25.467 --> 00:03:27.868
So then I took a good --

00:03:27.868 --> 00:03:29.467
That was a real cigarette,
I think.

00:03:29.467 --> 00:03:31.601
[ Laughter ]

00:03:31.601 --> 00:03:33.567
Was that real?

00:03:33.567 --> 00:03:38.200
[Bleep] brought me back
to the good old days!

00:03:38.200 --> 00:03:41.133
Give me a thousand more!

00:03:41.133 --> 00:03:43.133
Seth, I quit.

00:03:43.133 --> 00:03:45.334
I'm smoking cigarettes
full time.

00:03:45.334 --> 00:03:46.434
So then...

00:03:46.434 --> 00:03:48.834
[ Laughter ]

00:03:48.834 --> 00:03:50.033
[Bleep] me up.

00:03:50.033 --> 00:03:53.868
So then I took a good long look
at this guy,

00:03:53.868 --> 00:03:55.834
and I was like,
"What the [bleep]

00:03:55.834 --> 00:03:57.667
is your skin-care routine?"

00:03:57.667 --> 00:03:58.901
My God!

00:03:58.901 --> 00:04:01.434
What are you, a newborn baby?

00:04:01.434 --> 00:04:04.334
God dang,
you got some beautiful skin.

00:04:04.334 --> 00:04:06.033
What is that, Fenty?

00:04:06.033 --> 00:04:09.000
Are you a person
or a Lensa AI portrait?

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:12.000
I'd love to ask him,
but you know he just gonna lie.

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:15.534
But then something that makes me
personally very mad happened.

00:04:15.534 --> 00:04:18.567
Okay, so Politico had an article
about narcissists

00:04:18.567 --> 00:04:21.200
with pictures of Elon Musk,
Trump, and Kanye,

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:22.434
and I was like, "What?"

00:04:22.434 --> 00:04:25.701
But then I looked closer,
and I was like "What?!"

00:04:25.701 --> 00:04:27.467
Is that Meghan Markle?

00:04:27.467 --> 00:04:30.767
What in the world did she do
to be called a narcissist?

00:04:30.767 --> 00:04:32.501
Is it because
she pointed out racism?

00:04:32.501 --> 00:04:35.133
Because if that's what it takes
to be called a narcissist,

00:04:35.133 --> 00:04:37.567
you can call me Mark Zuckerberg.

00:04:37.567 --> 00:04:40.334
Also, to prove
she's a narcissist,

00:04:40.334 --> 00:04:42.601
the article cites Harry's book,

00:04:42.601 --> 00:04:44.834
but where is the picture
of Harry?

00:04:44.834 --> 00:04:46.133
He wrote a whole book,

00:04:46.133 --> 00:04:48.467
and somehow it's
his black wife's fault?

00:04:48.467 --> 00:04:50.067
They're mad
that she left Britain

00:04:50.067 --> 00:04:52.267
to protect her black kids,
but can you blame her?

00:04:52.267 --> 00:04:54.467
This world is so hostile
to black children,

00:04:54.467 --> 00:04:57.133
I was one and quit.

00:04:57.133 --> 00:04:58.734
I was 8 years old talking about,

00:04:58.734 --> 00:05:00.901
"If they're going to
treat me like this,

00:05:00.901 --> 00:05:02.367
I'm going to get a job."

00:05:02.367 --> 00:05:05.033
And that's when I started
working at "Late Night."

00:05:05.033 --> 00:05:06.367
I'm 16.

00:05:06.367 --> 00:05:08.267
[ Laughter ]

00:05:08.267 --> 00:05:12.567
Speaking of us children,
I saw this trend on TikTok

00:05:12.567 --> 00:05:14.033
where children
lie to their parents

00:05:14.033 --> 00:05:16.868
and say a celebrity died
to film their reaction,

00:05:16.868 --> 00:05:19.000
and I was like, "What?
That's awful!

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:21.334
Whose idea was that?
George Santos?"

00:05:21.334 --> 00:05:24.767
But then I saw a few more,
and I was like,

00:05:24.767 --> 00:05:26.501
"Okay, some of these
are a little funny."

00:05:26.501 --> 00:05:28.701
So I'm going to try it
on my comedy daddy,

00:05:28.701 --> 00:05:30.400
little soccer-loving Seth.

00:05:30.400 --> 00:05:33.601
Hey, Seth, did you hear this?

00:05:33.601 --> 00:05:36.033
Soccer legend Pelé died.

00:05:36.033 --> 00:05:37.534
-Yeah, I know.
He died last week.

00:05:37.534 --> 00:05:38.801
It was really sad.

00:05:38.801 --> 00:05:41.767
-He did?! What?!
That's horrible!

00:05:41.767 --> 00:05:43.834
So then I found out
that Pelé died,

00:05:43.834 --> 00:05:47.100
and I was like, "He did?!
What?! That's horrible!"

00:05:47.100 --> 00:05:50.367
So then the funniest thing
in the world happened.

00:05:50.367 --> 00:05:54.234
I saw this tweet from
former kickboxer Andrew Tate,

00:05:54.234 --> 00:05:57.133
where he tweeted at
environmentalist Greta Thunberg

00:05:57.133 --> 00:05:59.968
bragging about all his cars
and their huge emissions,

00:05:59.968 --> 00:06:01.501
out of nowhere, for no reason.

00:06:01.501 --> 00:06:02.968
And I was like, "What?"

00:06:02.968 --> 00:06:05.467
He's like "Send me your e-mail

00:06:05.467 --> 00:06:08.067
for a complete list
of all my sports cars."

00:06:08.067 --> 00:06:10.367
And I as like, "What are you
doing bullying this child?

00:06:10.367 --> 00:06:13.000
How do you expect her
to stand up to a grown-ass man?"

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:15.734
And then she replied
and told him to e-mail her

00:06:15.734 --> 00:06:19.467
at smalldickenergy@getalife.com.

00:06:19.467 --> 00:06:25.767
And I was like, "Whaaaat
a terrible burn!"

00:06:25.767 --> 00:06:28.901
So after that, it was over.
Just kidding.

00:06:28.901 --> 00:06:32.334
This man was so pressed
that this child burned him

00:06:32.334 --> 00:06:34.067
that he made a reply video.

00:06:34.067 --> 00:06:37.667
Now, it's like him in a robe,
smoking a cigar,

00:06:37.667 --> 00:06:40.300
getting a pizza delivery,
like, holding a pizza box.

00:06:40.300 --> 00:06:43.033
And I was like, "What?
What are you doing?"

00:06:43.033 --> 00:06:44.801
And that's where
it all went to crap.

00:06:44.801 --> 00:06:48.200
Because the very next day,
authorities arrested him.

00:06:48.200 --> 00:06:50.267
He got arrested
on like a billion charges

00:06:50.267 --> 00:06:53.033
of, like, the worst stuff
I have ever heard.

00:06:53.033 --> 00:06:54.567
And I was like, "What?!"

00:06:54.567 --> 00:06:56.868
Now, I don't want to get into
what he was charged with,

00:06:56.868 --> 00:07:00.968
but let's just say
he could open for Bill Cosby.

00:07:00.968 --> 00:07:04.734
And then in the single
most savage tweet of all time,

00:07:04.734 --> 00:07:06.734
Greta tweeted,
"This is what happens

00:07:06.734 --> 00:07:09.434
when you don't recycle
your pizza boxes."

00:07:09.434 --> 00:07:12.567
I was like, "Whaaat?!"

00:07:12.567 --> 00:07:13.734
Oh, my God.

00:07:13.734 --> 00:07:15.834
For an environmentalist,

00:07:15.834 --> 00:07:19.567
this child sure does love
scorched earth.

00:07:19.567 --> 00:07:22.534
Now, that is why it's important
to raise your child right.

00:07:22.534 --> 00:07:25.033
Just ask Seth's dad,
Lorne Michaels.

00:07:25.033 --> 00:07:26.033
[ Laughter ]

00:07:26.033 --> 00:07:28.067
This has been "Amber Says What."

00:07:28.067 --> 00:07:29.634
Give me that cigarette.

